Pulse oximeters"},{"text":"Capnography systems"}]}]},{"heading":"Quality & Safety Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Accurate PFT results depend heavily on patient effort, equipment calibration and standardized technique."},{"type":"p","text":"Key areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Daily calibration/verification as required by equipment and laboratory protocols"},{"text":"Infection-control procedures"},{"text":"Disposable filter/mouthpiece handling"},{"text":"Equipment maintenance"},{"text":"Patient screening"},{"text":"Reproducibility assessment"},{"text":"Correct data entry"},{"text":"Documentation of technical limitations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A technically poor test should be recognized and appropriately repeated or escalated rather than reported as reliable data."}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Professional Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Useful additional training areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Basic Life Support (BLS)"},{"text":"Spirometry"},{"text":"Pulmonary function testing"},{"text":"Respiratory physiology"},{"text":"Infection prevention"},{"text":"Occupational spirometry"},{"text":"Sleep-study fundamentals"},{"text":"Capnography"},{"text":"Pulmonary rehabilitation"},{"text":"Respiratory critical care"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Hands-on training and competency assessment are particularly important for PFT work."}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Potential postgraduate pathways include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.Sc Respiratory Therapy / Respiratory Care"},{"text":"M.Sc Respiratory Care Technology"},{"text":"M.Sc Pulmonary Function / Respiratory-related programs"},{"text":"Master's in Allied Health Sciences"},{"text":"Clinical Research"},{"text":"Public Health"},{"text":"Healthcare Management"},{"text":"Hospital Administration"},{"text":"Healthcare Quality Management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a technical diagnos